---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { GITHUB_URL, LINKEDIN_URL, CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../consts";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Issei Kuzuki. Senior data engineer at Curve Analytics, working on data platforms and LLM infrastructure."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    I'm Issei Kuzuki. Engineer working on data platforms and LLM
    infrastructure. Currently senior data engineer at Curve Analytics,
    building the agentic analytics layer. Cambridge engineering before
    that.
  </p>

  <p>
    Most of what I write on this site is fieldwork from the edges of
    running LLMs in production: cost shape, observability, agent
    orchestration, the specific ways a deployment can fail quietly.
    The five posts in <a href="/writing/">writing</a> are the early
    set.
  </p>

  <p>
    The larger personal project is <a href="/projects/fpl-pulse/">FPL Pulse</a>,
    a weekly LLM enrichment pipeline and an agentic transfer
    recommendation engine, both running end-to-end on AWS. The
    <a href="https://fpl.isseikuzuki.co.uk/">dashboard is live</a>; the
    architecture writeup sits in <a href="/projects/">projects</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Reach me</h2>

  <ul class="post-list">
    <li><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></li>
    <li><a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a> (<code>ikuzuki</code>)</li>
    <li><a href={LINKEDIN_URL}>LinkedIn</a></li>
  </ul>

  <p class="muted">
    The full work history and the verifiable seniority bits live on
    LinkedIn. This page is the short version.
  </p>
</Base>
